: "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw", "html_url": "https://github.com/woodruffw", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-17T14:05:31Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-17T14:05:31Z", "body": "Okay, thanks for confirming. I'm going to triage this as a duplicate of https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/15968, since it's another case where AVs interfere with uv in ways we can't easily control or predict.", "author_association": "MEMBER", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/comments/4731139712/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/comments/4737199669", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/19873#issuecomment-4737199669", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/19873", "id": 4737199669, "node_id": "IC_kwDOKbIFZc8AAAABGlvuNQ", "user": {"login": "zWingz", "id": 13031838, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDMxODM4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13031838?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/zWingz", "html_url": "https://github.com/zWingz", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zWingz/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zWingz/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zWingz/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zWingz/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zWingz/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zWingz/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zWingz/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zWingz/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zWingz/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-18T02:09:05Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-18T02:09:05Z", "body": "@woodruffw I tested it, and the occurrence rate in 0.9.28 is much lower than in 0.10.x and above. Could this be due to a version issue?", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/comments/4737199669/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/comments/4776480123", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/19873#issuecomment-4776480123", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/19873", "id": 4776480123, "node_id": "IC_kwDOKbIFZc8AAAABHLNNew", "user": {"login": "ottokruse", "id": 6275520, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU1MjA=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6275520?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ottokruse", "html_url": "https://github.com/ottokruse", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ottokruse/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ottokruse/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ottokruse/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ottokruse/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ottokruse/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ottokruse/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ottokruse/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ottokruse/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ottokruse/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-23T06:45:44Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-23T06:45:44Z", "body": "Hi @woodruffw this is not a dupe of https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/15968 ? Shoving all AV/Windows defender issues under that one seems not helpful?\n\nI also run into the issue here. On corporate Windows VDI, `uv tool install --force mistral-vibe` fails with uv 0.11.23.\n\nEnvironment:\n\n```text\nOS: Windows 11 / Windows Server 2025-era build? `PSVersionTable` reports build 26100\nPowerShell: 5.1.26100.7462\nUser install, no admin\nuv: uv 0.11.23 (3cdf50e09 2026-06-19 x86_64-pc-windows-msvc)\nPython on PATH: Python 3.14.6\nuv-managed Pythons installed: 3.13.13, 3.12.13\n```\n\nFailure:\n\n```\nerror: Failed to install: pywin32-311-cp313-cp313-win_amd64.whl\n  Caused by: Failed to update Windows PE resources: AppData\\Local\\Temp\\.tmp...\\uv-trampoline-25112.exe\n  Caused by: Access is denied. (os error -2147024891)\n```\n\nAlso reproduced with:\n\n`uv tool install --force --python 3.12 mistral-vibe`\n`uv tool install --force --reinstall --link-mode copy --python 3.12 mistral-vibe`\n\nSame failure class. With custom TEMP, error changed to:\n\n`Failed to update Windows PE resources: .uvtmp\\.tmp...\\uv-trampoline-24500.exe`\n`Caused by: The system cannot open the device or file specified. (os error -2147024786)`\n\nLikely AV/EDR/Defender interference while uv creates then mutates the temporary trampoline executable.\n\nComparison with uv 0.9.8:\n\nuv 0.9.8 (85c5d3228 2025-11-07)\nuv 0.9.8 can install the tool environment successfully:\n\nmistral-vibe v2.17.1\n- vibe\n- vibe-acp\n\nand the actual executable exists:\n\n%APPDATA%\\uv\\tools\\mistral-vibe\\Scripts\\vibe.exe\n\nbut no shim is copied to:\n\n`%USERPROFILE%\\.local\\bin`\n\nso vibe is not on PATH.\n\nWorkaround: install with uv 0.9.8, then add a .cmd wrapper in `%USERPROFILE%\\.local\\bin`", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/comments/4776480123/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 1, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]}